                        kind @note
                        text "Found by verify.misc and verify.exec: DbErr::UpdateGetPrimaryKey is unreachable (Update::one's prepare_filters panics \"PrimaryKey is not set\" before find_updated_model_by_id could report it); DbErr::Conn and DbErr::Exec plus the conn_err/exec_err/json_err helpers have no production call sites (#[allow(dead_code)]). Same shape as the removed ConnAcquireErr. Options per item: delete, or make reachable (e.g. prepare_filters returning Err(UpdateGetPrimaryKey) instead of panicking — an API improvement worth considering while there). error.model is at +1; this bumps it again. Pinned in tests/error_model_tests.rs and noted in tests/returning_tests.rs."
